    {
      "id": "note",
      "kind": "markdown_note",
      "x": -1180.0,
      "y": 160.0,
      "settings": {
        "title": "B-34004B witness — 2026-11-19",
        "body": "# B-34004B FAT — witness 2026-11-19\n\n> ⚠ **SAMPLE DATA.** Test Points, MRT Log and NPSH are pre-filled with the\n> **B-34004A** certified results (Sundyne, 12/13/2011) so every node computes.\n> Overwrite each row with today's B readings. Until then, every verdict on this\n> canvas is A's, not B's.\n\n**Datasheet:** I-FD-5290.00-22315-311-SWM-001 rev B — 9.80 m³/h · 333.8 m · 26.9 kW · 32.7 % · shut-off 357.37 m · SG 0.999 · 0.520 cSt @ 53 °C · NPSHa 2.4 m.\n**Criteria:** API 610 8th + N-553 (Rated Point). Report cover: fill Serial No. in Report Export.\n\n## Data entry (same conventions as A)\nType the vendor's numbers **as printed**; every column keeps its own unit.\n- Q [US GPM] · P_suc [psi g] = 0 · P_dis [psi g] = ΔP · T [°F] = suction temperature\n- N [rpm] = **pump** speed = motor rpm × 2.871 (gearbox)\n- P [hp] = **motor output** (Sundyne \"MOTOR HP\")\n- Vibration Test Points columns: gearbox housing, in/s RMS (overall and filtered)\n\n## Checklist\n1. Instrument calibration certificates; gearbox ratio 2.871; record B serial no.\n2. Performance: overwrite **Test Points** row by row; watch the Head / η columns.\n3. **Compliance**: head, power, shut-off (η is information only); test speed within 3 % of 10 212 rpm.\n4. **NPSH**: enter B's NPSH3 points (or delete the rows if not tested).\n5. **MRT Log**: 4 h at design flow, log every 15 min; **MRT Check** for vibration, stabilisation, duration.\n6. **Report Export** ▸ Export all (docx + tex + pdf). Save the project.\n\n## A results, for comparison (what \"normal\" looked like)\n| Item | A | Watch on B |\n|---|---|---|\n| Head at rated | +1.72 % (band −2/+2 % above 300 m) | tight: small drop → fail |\n| Vibration overall (gearbox) | 3.5–3.8 mm/s RMS | above the 8th-ed. 3.0 mm/s limit on A |\n| MRT power | 28.6–29.7 kW | design max 33.1 kW |\n| Lube oil / sump | 42–44 psig / 116–124 °F | |\n| Seal cavity | 64.9–69.3 psig | |\n| NPSH3 at rated | 1.08 m (quoted 1.24 m) | |\n\n## Open points carried from A\n- Datasheet calls N-553 **rev C**; the overlay used is rev E 7.3 — confirm the NPSH rule.\n- SG: datasheet 0.999, Sundyne's conversion 0.990 and 0.50 cSt.\n- Vibration readings: Sundyne states RMS although FFT printouts read \"pk\" — confirm for B.\n",
        "report": true
      }
    },
